/-! ## Tier 3 Phase W.18 — full FS-MESSAGE axis for norm / rot / tr

W.17 covered only withdrawal. W.18 extends the full FS-MESSAGE
binding (prefix || X-point bytes) to the remaining 3 sigma protocols:
normalization, rotation, transfer. For each protocol we pin 2
message shapes:
  * `{norm,rot,tr}MsgA` — prefix || G (1 X-point).
  * `{norm,rot,tr}MsgB` — prefix || H || G (2 X-points, swapped order;
     directly pins X-point ordering per-protocol).
3 protocols × 2 shapes × 2 bindings (SHA-512 + challenge scalar) =
12 new binding rows.
-/

